<title>USA: Duke Realty Investments expands portfolio.</title>
<headline>Duke Realty Investments expands portfolio.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Duke Realty Investments Inc said Thursday it began four developments and made two acquisitions covering a total of 731,000 square feet.</p>
<p>Three of the new developments are suburban office projects in Ohio and the fourth is an industrial property in Nashville, Tennessee, Duke Realty said. The company said the two acquisitions are office and industrial buildings in the Cincinnati and Indianapolis areas.</p>
<p>The real estate investment trust said it invested a total of $51.2 million in the properties.</p>
<p>Duke Realty shares closed off 1/4 Thursday at 39-3/4.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
